playwright-report/
test-results/
# Issue #52 exact-head CI/final-main captures are transient, but the course-facing
# repository-evidence snapshot stays tracked so a reviewer/instructor can browse it
# directly in GitHub without opening an Actions artifact.
artifacts/lab-03/screenshots/issue-52/*
!artifacts/lab-03/screenshots/issue-52/README.md
!artifacts/lab-03/screenshots/issue-52/repository-evidence-*/
!artifacts/lab-03/screenshots/issue-52/repository-evidence-*/**
# prisma
server/prisma/*.db
# private runtime attachment bytes
server/uploads/
# logs & OS
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
